      {
        "body": "The promise of silent refresh before expiry relied on a one-hour access-token lifetime. User verified fifteen-minute expiry on the current plan in token payload and provider dashboard and identified this mismatch as the logout cause. Refresh timing needs correction and verification; no implementation fix has been confirmed.",
